What this solution actually does: it periodically reconciles four local Windows Services with TOMI business-day and operating-window settings. It starts or stops the SPEI CEP generator, SPID CEP generator, SPID FIEL and SPID Accionistas services, records execution bookkeeping and raises control-error alerts. It is a supervisor, not the generator or payment-message processor. All projects target .NET Framework 4.8 / x86. Simple Injector provides scoped dependencies; the host derives from shared MUFG_T24 lifecycle code. The current understanding (../architecture/CEP_ControladorServicios/Application_understanding_technical_document.md) and dependency ladder (../excecutive_docs/CEP_ControladorServicios/Base_Project_Dependency_Ladder.md) contain the complete composition and runtime map.
