5. Architecture-Fit Note
Apply the standing architecture question in _ORCHESTRATION.md (./_ORCHESTRATION.md). This workload is bounded periodic local-SCM reconciliation, not a continuous payment listener or multi-step financial saga. A Windows Service is a reasonable fit. Correct defects, make dependencies reproducible and add tests before changing hosting.
Option	Fits when	Trade-offs / unknowns
Modernize current service in place	Local SCM control and existing operations remain required	Lowest disruption; requires safe shutdown, testing and dependency discipline
Modern .NET Worker on Windows	Approved runtime/support lifecycle and Windows permissions allow it	Better hosting APIs; shared Framework dependencies may block migration
